    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gearbound: Odyssey</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a fast-paced first-person platformer inspired by the early <i>Ratchet &amp; Clank</i> games but with a twist: it\u2019s all in first-person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, blast, and explore your way across a variety of vibrant, handcrafted planets. Each level brings something new to the table from towering industrial complexes to lush alien jungles  packed with platforming challenges, hidden secrets, and a wild cast of enemies to take down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll collect unique weapons and gadgets as you go, giving you new ways to fight and explore. Whether it\u2019s hopping across floating platforms or using high-tech tools to reach hidden areas, movement and creativity are at the heart of the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gearbound: Odyssey</strong> mixes classic platformer vibes with the intensity and immersion of a first-person perspective. It\u2019s all about tight movement, satisfying combat, and that feeling of discovery as you uncover what\u2019s waiting on the next world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Stages:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/94c138a527b5d8b9e091c1b666285137.avif?t=1748477994\" data-has-big width=800 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Codex Entry:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cEvery journey starts with a spark. The Conduit may not look like much now but give it time, and it\u2019ll carry your will across the ruins of the old world.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/972d999139d567fd95dfc9191e0206bb.avif?t=1748477994\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Codex Entry:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cStone conceals. Light remembers. The truth of the past lies dormant in these fractured cores, whispering through time for someone to listen.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/e73ecfa0e6d285dad428f0025ac25268.avif?t=1748477994\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Actors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ember:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N/A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chomper:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N/A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grenadier:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N/A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Game Code:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authored by <strong>EvolvedPhoenix</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assets Utilized:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Game Kit Character Pack<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/7fe6559887cae00a9e8f7eca18468273.avif?t=1748477994\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Game Kit Props Pack<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/c9209b36b4e90f71269b03fb6138ac60.avif?t=1748477994\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Game Kit Environment Pack<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto